    <li><strong>Customers</strong> — PUBLIC grade product technical documents, API guides, and release impact notices. The dual management of <strong>building a separate customer documentation site and letting it go stale again</strong> disappears — because when the code changes, the customer documents are updated through the same pipeline.</li>
    <li><strong>AI Agent</strong> — using the llms.txt and graph JSON contracts of the AI consumption layer as they are, the in-house assistant and the customer support bot answer from the same knowledge with evidence (sources included). The human view and the machine view come out of one repository — and the foremost consumer of this machine view is <strong>AI coding</strong> below.</li>
